| Cancellation rate | {{ (a.cancellation_rate_pct | string ~ '%') if a.cancellation_rate_pct is defined and a.cancellation_rate_pct is not none else '—' }} |
| Overall on-time reliability | {{ (a.overall_on_time_pct | string ~ '%') if a.overall_on_time_pct is defined and a.overall_on_time_pct is not none else '—' }} |
| Arrival samples | {{ a.arrival_samples }} |
| On-time arrivals (≤15 min late) | {{ a.on_time_arrivals }}{% if a.on_time_arrival_pct is not none %} ({{ a.on_time_arrival_pct }}%){% endif %} |
| Early arrivals | {{ a.early_arrivals }} |
| Delayed arrivals (>15 min) | {{ a.late_arrivals }} |
| Average arrival variance | {{ (a.average_arrival_variance_min | string ~ ' min') if a.average_arrival_variance_min is not none else '—' }} |
| Worst arrival delay | {{ (a.worst_arrival_delay_min | string ~ ' min') if a.worst_arrival_delay_min is not none else '—' }} |
| Departure samples | {{ a.departure_samples }} |
| Early / late departures | {{ a.early_departures }} / {{ a.late_departures }} |
{% for traveler, t in (a.travelers or {}) | dictsort %}
**{{ state_attr(traveler, "friendly_name") or traveler }}:** {{ t.completed_flights }} flight(s); {{ t.on_time_arrivals }}/{{ t.arrival_samples }} on-time arrivals
